  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Версия моего ресурспака x512 с разрешением x128. Другие разрешения: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/isaiahs-faithful-x128\" rel=\"nofollow\">x128 <em>(эта)</em></a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/faithful-hd\" rel=\"nofollow\">x512</a></span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.apexminecrafthosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d3548\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/679/410/bg3.png\"></a></p><p>Просмотреть загрузки для <span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/isaiahs-faithful-x128/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:8857\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.19/1.18.2</a>, <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/isaiahs-faithful-x128/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:8516\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.17.1</a>, или <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fisaiahmc.github.io%252fresourcepack%252fx128%252fout%252fiFaithfulx128_1.12.zip\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.12.2</a></span></p><p style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Кредит</strong><br>Вдохновение:<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaithful.team%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:32px\">Faithful x32</span></a> <br><br>Инструменты:<br><a href=\"https://github.com/nagadomi/waifu2x\" rel=\"nofollow\">- waifu2x</a> для увеличения текстур по умолчанию 16x в 8x до x512 для трассировки.<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvectormagic.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">- VectorMagic</a> для черновых контуров.<br>- <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvpaint.app%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">vpaint</a> мое приложение для рисования</p><p>Скриншот дома.</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/406/682/2021-11-07_00.jpg\" width=\"187\" height=\"221\"></p><p><span style=\"color:#cff\">Faithful 128, Faithful x128, Faithful 64<br></span></p>",
